  {
   "t": 0,
   "text": "More goals come from second balls than from the cross itself. This covers that.",
   "hold": 2.5,
   "beat": "hook"
  },
  {
   "t": 0,
   "text": "The penalty area plus a ten metre zone outside it, with two defenders holding that zone.",
   "hold": 2.5,
   "beat": "picture"
  },
  {
   "t": 3.74,
   "text": "The cross comes in, and the header only clears it into the second ball zone.",
   "hold": 2.5,
   "beat": "action"
  },
  {
   "t": 8.22,
   "text": "The outside defender reacts first, wins it, and clears well beyond the zone.",
   "hold": 2.5,
   "beat": "action"
  },
  {
   "t": 14.94,
   "text": "Once they've got it, allow only one defender to hold the outside zone.",
   "hold": 2.5,
   "beat": "progression"
  },
  {
   "t": 17.44,
   "text": "Attackers only score off the second ball here, so that zone can never be empty.",
